  "scoring_note": "combine: how acceptance_score is made from the sections. 'weighted' = the weighted mean by `sections`; 'mission_gate' = the weighted mean of the five scene sections (their `sections` weights) times the control section; any other name selects the block sections_<name> (e.g. 'mission_0.8': the mission at 0.8, the five scene sections at 0.2 in their proportions). progress_gate: the mission's checks a run earns without doing its jobs count only as far as it did them: the bucket's three (lift-off level, swing, water kept) only in a run that put the fire out, the safety checks (parts not dropped, no losses, no collisions, separation; consistency by the mean) in proportion to each run's progress, (steam released + fire out + station cleared) / 3. The verdict's metrics record the acceptance under every combination, with and without the gate (acceptance.<combine>[.progress_gate]). The anchor follows the switch (anchor.json, by_combine); the agent's text must be changed to match: tests/review/scoring_options.md.",
